Fri Oct 23 16:33:17 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 6.2.6
  * New TeeCancelIO API
  * Linux: import libmei 1.8.3, build for Android using Android NDK
  * Linux: return NOT_SUPPORTED on ENODATA, fix empty kind and
    cancel pipe handling
  * Fix TeeGetKind with handle; fix cpp wrapper and add samples
  * EFI: add CSC target support, DEFINE_GUID, library configure and
    stdlib logging support; enable EFI builds of samples
  * CMake: install meteepp.h C++ header, require CMake 3.15 and
    overwrite FORTIFY_SOURCE from distribution; drop conan support
  * Windows: migrate to VS2022, fix print specifiers, limit buffer size
- Rename shlib package to libmetee6_2_6_0 following the four-part
  library version
- Ship the newly installed meteepp.h header in the devel package

